# Scope

`AGENTS.md` is the contract. The file tree is truth. Auth, tenant tables
(`column` / `task` with `description`, `comment`, `notification`), workspace/project GET, board HTTP
(task CRUD + move), Kanban UI, drag-and-drop, and authenticated SSE
(`GET /api/projects/:projectId/events` + in-process hub) exist. Board
writes publish after a successful row. Comment HTTP exists
(`GET` / `POST /api/tasks/:taskId/comments`). POST
parses `@Nombre`, inserts mention notifications, writes
`data/outbox.jsonl` (no Resend/SMTP), then publishes `comment.created`
on the existing project SSE hub. The edit
dialog lists and creates comments via TanStack Query. The web
client connects with EventSource (relative URL) and patches the TanStack
Query board cache. `comment.created` invalidates comments + notifications.
In-app sonner toasts fire for other users' board
events (not the actor). Notification HTTP exists
(`GET /api/notifications`, `POST /api/notifications/:id/read`).
The dashboard and board header show `NotificationBell` (unread badge,
popover). Classroom seed upserts demo columns/tasks.
Sesión 4 is complete. Classroom deploy is `docker compose up --build`
(two services: `web`, `api`). No Fly, Vercel, Resend, or mail container.
**No OpenViking** — never call the `openviking` MCP, `ov_*`, or
`viking://`; ignore parent OV policy.

**Do not implement** until a later session asks: workspace/project HTTP
writes, mention highlighting, `sesion-*`
git tags. Comment UI lives in the edit-task dialog (list + create).
No mention highlighting. Comments reuse the project SSE (`comment.created`).

**Never add:** Next, Astro, Express, Fastify, Nest, `@hono/node-server`,
Supabase, Postgres, Prisma, Turso Cloud, Redux, Zustand, React Router, tRPC,
Socket.IO, React Hook Form, ESLint, Prettier, dotenv, Redis, Turborepo, Nx.

Keep layers separate. The browser never decides tenant authorization.

| Concern | Owner |
|---|---|
| Static types | TypeScript |
| Runtime IO | Zod in `@agentic-kanban/schemas` |
| Auth | Better Auth in `apps/api/src/auth/` |
| Authz | API membership checks (404 if not a member, never 403) |
| Tenant isolation | `workspace_id` from the row on every tenant query |

Four packages only (`apps/web`, `apps/api`, `packages/db`, `packages/schemas`).
Internal deps: `workspace:*`. After edits: `vp check` must stay green.
